   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Unreal condition, present and past",
     "texto": [
      "For a present hypothetical situation: **Wenn ich mehr Zeit hätte, würde ich öfter reisen**. For an unfulfilled past condition: **Wenn wir früher gekommen wären, hätten wir den Zug erreicht**. Inversion without **wenn** is possible in both cases: **Hätte ich mehr Zeit, würde ich öfter reisen** / **Wären wir früher gekommen, hätten wir den Zug erreicht**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Word order and meaning",
     "texto": [
      "In the subordinate clause with **wenn**, the conjugated verb goes at the end; in the main clause it takes second position. If **wenn** is omitted, the conjugated verb opens the condition. The tense of the Konjunktiv II distinguishes the present hypothesis from the past one; do not translate **wäre/hätte** word for word without looking at the rest of the sentence."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "With wenn",
